      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should need to replace operands as well. They could be constants, so wouldn\u0027t be updated by replacing results of other instructions.\n\nexample: a var whose initializer is a constant. You\u0027ve changed the type of the var, but not the initializer.\n\nSee DecomposeMatrixStride for the extra check we do for operand updates.",
