      "message": "This would be clearer if actually named `TransposeArrayHelper`, since it doesn\u0027t actually do any loading or storing (aside from its internal temporaries). Then the use from `store` would make more sense.\n\nThat said, it would probably be more efficient to make actual load/store helpers that transpose and load/store one matrix at a time, rather than storing the whole intermediate transposed array. Probably not that important though, assuming that most reasonable shaders would hopefully avoid loading/storing whole arrays of matrices...",
